&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;For each of the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, total expenses related to these commitments and contracts were $13 million. The expenses are reflected in Account 401 "Operation Expenses" on our income statements.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;10. Supplemental Cash Flow Information&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The following table contains supplemental cash flow information (in millions):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="-aw-import: ignore;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table style="border-collapse: collapse;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"&gt;

