          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;">Includes CIG Observation Wells (Boehm, Flank, Fort Morgan, Latigo) + Totem Field Observation Wells. </xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
