        <xhtml:p class="MsoNormal">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">The cost rate percentage of common equity is based on the settlement in Docket No. RP11-2107.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
