        <xhtml:p class="MsoNormal">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Depreciation, Depletion and Amortization of Gas Plant - Intangible Plant</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:p class="MsoNormal">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Depreciation expense is computed on a composite basis using the following rates:</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
        <xhtml:table class="MsoTableGrid" style="border-collapse: collapse; border: none; width: 479px; height: 164px;" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
          <xhtml:tbody>
